  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "6659462",
      "title": "Creating the Template for the (Reactive) Recipe Edit Form",
      "lectureOrder": 551,
      "videoOrder": 506,
      "sourceHash": "43dbeba19dc542865fa8f922ffc2a4d65de912477d513859cfbe4804959de0e6",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.31,
          "end": 3.72,
          "en": "Instructor: In the last lectures,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.72,
          "end": 7.5,
          "en": "we edited our form using the template-driven approach.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.5,
          "end": 10.44,
          "en": "Now let's move on to the reactive approach",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.44,
          "end": 13.803,
          "en": "for the new recipe or editing an existing one.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.64,
          "end": 17.73,
          "en": "We got our recipe-edit component here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.73,
          "end": 20.52,
          "en": "and it doesn't have a form inside of it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.52,
          "end": 22.803,
          "en": "so we should definitely change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.09,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "In here, I will start by adding a row and then a column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 31.14,
          "en": "which should span the full width on all device sizes",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 31.14,
          "end": 33.06,
          "en": "and then the form without an action,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.06,
          "end": 35.01,
          "en": "because we don't want to send a request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 35.01,
          "end": 37.02,
          "en": "we want to handle it in Angular.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.02,
          "end": 40.2,
          "en": "Now we will need a couple of inputs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 40.2,
          "end": 41.7,
          "en": "I will actually begin",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 41.7,
          "end": 44.67,
          "en": "with the Save and Cancel buttons though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 44.67,
          "end": 46.62,
          "en": "So right at the start of this form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 46.62,
          "end": 48.96,
          "en": "I'll have another bootstrap row,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.96,
          "end": 52.2,
          "en": "col-xs-12 will be the width,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 52.2,
          "end": 56.5,
          "en": "and here, I want to have a button of type submit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 57.39,
          "end": 61.14,
          "en": "with a class of btn and then btn-success so",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 61.14,
          "end": 65.13,
          "en": "that it's a green button, which should simply save the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 65.13,
          "end": 67.71,
          "en": "it should save the recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 67.71,
          "end": 69.06,
          "en": "I'll have a second button",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 69.06,
          "end": 73.62,
          "en": "of type btn so that it doesn't submit the form,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 73.62,
          "end": 76.47,
          "en": "which will get the class btn-danger,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 76.47,
          "end": 79.263,
          "en": "which should simply cancel the editing here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 80.31,
          "end": 82.02,
          "en": "So these are the two buttons which allow me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 82.02,
          "end": 83.763,
          "en": "to control the form in the end.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 84.6,
          "end": 86.76,
          "en": "Now for the inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 86.76,
          "end": 91.76,
          "en": "I definitely want a row with my default column width here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 92.58,
          "end": 96.36,
          "en": "where I will add a div with the form-group CSS class,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 96.36,
          "end": 98.88,
          "en": "to simply use that bootstrap CSS class",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 98.88,
          "end": 100.89,
          "en": "to give it some nice styling.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 100.89,
          "end": 105.12,
          "en": "Then I'll add a label for the name of that recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 105.12,
          "end": 109.62,
          "en": "and I'll say Name here, and I will add the input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 109.62,
          "end": 113.82,
          "en": "The input will be of type text with the id name, maybe,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 113.82,
          "end": 117.45,
          "en": "and let's already structure this over multiple lines",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 117.45,
          "end": 121.8,
          "en": "and with a class of form-control to make it look nice.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.8,
          "end": 125.04,
          "en": "Now, I will actually copy that row",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.04,
          "end": 128.04,
          "en": "and paste it in below this Name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.04,
          "end": 130.743,
          "en": "Here, I want to have my imagePath.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 131.73,
          "end": 135.15,
          "en": "So I'll name it Image URL here, this input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 135.15,
          "end": 136.77,
          "en": "And here I simply want the user",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.77,
          "end": 141.72,
          "en": "to paste in the image path, so that will be this row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 141.72,
          "end": 144.09,
          "en": "Below it, I'll add another row.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 144.09,
          "end": 147.18,
          "en": "Here, I won't have my form-group though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 147.18,
          "end": 150.72,
          "en": "instead I want to preview the image the user pasted in.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 150.72,
          "end": 155.25,
          "en": "So I will simply add my img element here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.25,
          "end": 157.48,
          "en": "I will later bind the source",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 158.67000000000002,
          "end": 162.45,
          "en": "and assign the img-responsive class to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 162.45,
          "end": 164.493,
          "en": "We will fine tune this later if needed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 165.39,
          "end": 169.17000000000002,
          "en": "So, that allows the user to enter title and an image",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.17000000000002,
          "end": 171.96,
          "en": "and see that image as a preview.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.96,
          "end": 175.77,
          "en": "Now I'll add another row with another label,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 175.77,
          "end": 178.14,
          "en": "which should now say Description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.14,
          "end": 179.79,
          "en": "so, the description of our recipe",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 179.79,
          "end": 181.74,
          "en": "or the content of the recipe.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 181.74,
          "end": 184.74,
          "en": "So I'll assign this for the id description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 184.74,
          "end": 188.37,
          "en": "which of course will be this, but this will not be an input.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 188.37,
          "end": 190.44,
          "en": "I'll change it to a textarea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 190.44,
          "end": 193.86,
          "en": "Therefore, I also need a closing tag for this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 193.86,
          "end": 196.92000000000002,
          "en": "On this textarea, I want to provide, let's say,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 196.92000000000002,
          "end": 200.16,
          "en": "six rows for typing so that it's not too big,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 200.16,
          "end": 202.89,
          "en": "not too small, should be okay.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 202.89,
          "end": 207.89,
          "en": "Well, and then below this, I'll add yet another div.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 208.35,
          "end": 210,
          "en": "This will later be required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 210,
          "end": 213.75,
          "en": "for the ingredients of that recipe here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 213.75,
          "end": 216.36,
          "en": "So here we will actually need to create an array",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 216.36,
          "end": 218.55,
          "en": "of controls and we'll need to manage this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 218.55,
          "end": 219.75,
          "en": "So we did learn how to do this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 219.75,
          "end": 223.53300000000002,
          "en": "but here we will see it in practice in a real project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 224.79,
          "end": 227.82,
          "en": "Now, here, as this will be for my array of items,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 227.82,
          "end": 230.91,
          "en": "I will get rid of the label and get rid of the id,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 230.91,
          "end": 233.7,
          "en": "also get rid of that div here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 233.7,
          "end": 237.03,
          "en": "Instead, I will add a new row inside of there,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 237.03,
          "end": 240.09,
          "en": "we're going to have multiple ingredients probably,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.09,
          "end": 243.15,
          "en": "and each row should then have a couple of columns,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 243.15,
          "end": 246.03,
          "en": "the first one spanning almost the entire width.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 246.03,
          "end": 250.83,
          "en": "It will hold the input for the name of the ingredient.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 250.83,
          "end": 255.63,
          "en": "the second one being very narrow next to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 255.63,
          "end": 257.88,
          "en": "which should hold the amount,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 257.88,
          "end": 261.99,
          "en": "and the third one, also, a very small column,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 261.99,
          "end": 264.21,
          "en": "should hold a button which allows me",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 264.21,
          "end": 268.53,
          "en": "to delete an ingredient, therefore btn-danger,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 268.53,
          "end": 270.69,
          "en": "and put an X on it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 270.69,
          "end": 272.34000000000003,
          "en": "So if we have a look at this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 272.34000000000003,
          "end": 274.32,
          "en": "that is how a single ingredient will look like.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 274.32,
          "end": 276.75,
          "en": "Now, we don't have descriptions for these inputs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 276.75,
          "end": 278.58,
          "en": "You could, of course, restructure this form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 278.58,
          "end": 280.53,
          "en": "and try placing labels next to them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 280.53,
          "end": 282.21,
          "en": "or use a different layout.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 282.21,
          "end": 284.55,
          "en": "I like that layout here though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 284.55,
          "end": 289.29,
          "en": "With that, we got the HTML code almost finished.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 289.29,
          "end": 290.43,
          "en": "There is something missing,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 290.43,
          "end": 295.43,
          "en": "but before we work on this, let's make this base form work",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 295.5,
          "end": 297.963,
          "en": "without ingredients for a start.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
